  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the Elsie Initiative Fund for Uniformed Women in Peace Operations the belief is challenges to financing should not prevent the advancement of gender equality. The Fund incentivizes the meaningful participation of women serving in uniformed police and military roles in UN peace operations.</narrative>
  </description>
